 |---|---|
 | `PORT` | HTTP port (default `8000`; set automatically by Render/Railway) |
 | `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `NVIDIA_API_KEY` | Enable LLM providers; without keys `/chat` uses the built-in parser |
